  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>You entwine arcane and divine magic into a magnificent synergy.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Theurgy<sup>UM</sup></p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When using Theurgy to enhance the level of a divine spell, its caster level is increased by an amount equal to the level of the arcane spell sacrificed, with a maximum increase equal to your mythic tier. When using Theurgy to enhance an arcane spell, the spell deals additional holy or unholy damage (as per the non-mythic feat) equal to your mythic tier times the level of the divine spell sacrificed.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/mythic-general-t-z-feats#toc5\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
